    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bowe Property are delighted to bring to the market 6 South Avenue, a wonderful four-bedroom detached family home ideally positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in Carrigaline. Built in 2003 and extending to approximately 140 sq m, this spacious home offers a lovely sense of privacy and space, while overlooking a generous green area to the front. The property also benefits from a B BER energy rating, adding further appeal for those seeking a comfortable and energy-efficient home. One of the key attractions of 6 South Avenue is undoubtedly its location. Carrigaline is a thriving and well-established town situated approximately 15 kilometres south of Cork City and is particularly popular with families due to its excellent range of schools, shops, sporting facilities, restaurants and everyday amenities. For commuters, Carrigaline is exceptionally well positioned, providing convenient access to Cork City, Cork Airport, Ringaskiddy and the wider harbour area. The town is served by regular bus services, while the nearby South Ring Road network provides straightforward connections throughout Cork and beyond. Properties offering this combination of a detached home, four bedrooms, ample parking and a peaceful cul-de-sac setting are always sought after. 6 South Avenue presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in a well-established and highly convenient Carrigaline location, with the added benefit of a B BER rating and the privacy afforded by its position at the end of the cul-de-sac."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n4.05m x 1.47m\r\nWarm and welcoming entrance with access to all accommodation. Timber flooring flows through to the living room and office. \r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\n5.90m x 3.3m\r\nSpacious living room which features a beautiful bay window, recessed lighting and solid fuel stove to create a cosy atmosphere. \r\n\r\nOffice \r\n2.78m x 2.35m  \r\nOverlooking the front garden, this versatile room is currently used by the owners as a home office but could easily be adapted to suit a variety of purposes, depending on the needs of the new owners. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room \r\n5.86m x 3.62m\r\nFeatures a fully fitted kitchen with both floor and eye level units. Benefits from integrated gas hob and electric oven, tiled floor and recessed lighting. Overlooks the rear garden with direct access to the rear garden via double doors. \r\n\r\nFamily Room \r\n3.36m x 3.30m\r\nGreat additional reception room located off the kitchen, it benefits from direct access to rear garden via sliding doors \r\n\r\nUtility Room \r\n2.63m x 0.90m\r\nThe room located off the kitchen, offers ample storage, access to the side of the house and has plumbing for washing machine. \r\n\r\nGuest WC \r\nComprises of two-piece suite, the floor is tiled.  Located off the hallway. \r\n\r\nLanding\r\n3.82m x 3.54m\r\nAccess to all bedroom accommodation and attic space. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\n4.72m x 4.02m \r\nA generous and spacious double bedroom overlooking the front garden, this bright room features a lovely bay window and carpet flooring.\r\nEn-Suite (2.59m x 1.08m)\r\nComprising of three-piece shower cubicle suite, fitted with pump shower. The floor and shower cubicle are tiled. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.17m x 3.57m\r\nSpacious double bedroom overlooking the rear garden, fitted with timber floor \r\nEn-Suite (2.46m x 0.80m)\r\nComprising of three-piece suite including a shower cubicle, fitted with pump shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.36m x 3.34m\r\nDouble bedroom overlooking the rear garden, finished with timber floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n2.95m x 2.06m\r\nSingle bedroom overlooking the front garden, finished with timber floor. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.54m x 2.28m\r\nA well-appointed four-piece bathroom suite comprising a bath and separate shower cubicle, fitted with an electric shower. The room features a tiled floor, with tiled surrounds to both the bath and shower area. \r\n\r\nGardens\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property is approached via a cobble lock driveway providing ample off-street parking, with mature shrubs, trees and hedging creating a pleasant sense of privacy. The property also enjoys a lovely outlook over a generous green area. To the rear, the garden is mainly laid in lawn and is complemented by mature shrubs, a dedicated patio seating area and a excellent garden shed, providing ample additional storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
